# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Open a batch {#open-a-batch}"
msgstr "Ouvrir un batch {#open-a-batch}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can open a runtime batch by using the context manager `with Batch(...)` or by initializing the `Batch`\n"
"class. When you start a batch,  you must specify a QPU by passing a `backend` object.  The batch starts when its first job begins execution.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tu peux ouvrir un batch Runtime en utilisant le gestionnaire de contexte `with Batch(...)` ou en instanciant la classe `Batch`.\n"
"Lorsque tu démarres un batch, tu dois spécifier un QPU en passant un objet `backend`. Le batch démarre quand son premier job commence à s'exécuter.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Batch class**\n"
msgstr "**Classe Batch**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Context manager**\n"
msgstr "**Gestionnaire de contexte**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The context manager automatically opens and closes the batch.\n"
msgstr "Le gestionnaire de contexte ouvre et ferme automatiquement le batch.\n"

